    <h1>Making Canva ads that print well on newsprint</h1>
    <p class="page-header__lede">A quick guide for Pōhutukawa Coast Times advertisers.</p>
    <div class="pdf-actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/files/advertising/canva-ad-tips.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download as PDF ↓</a>
